==Kumyk==

===Etymology===
{{bor+|kum|ru|армия}}, from {{der|kum|fr|armée|t=armed forces}}.

===Noun===
{{kum-noun|армия}}

# {{lb|kum|military}} [[army]] (organized military force of a nation)  
#: {{ux|kum|Къызыл '''армия'''|t=Red Army|inline=1}}   
# {{lb|kum|military}} [[military service]]  

====Usage notes====
* The borrowed term "армия" specifically denotes institutional armed forces, while native {{m|kum|аскер}} can refer to both armies and individual soldiers.

